## Evidence, Status, and Confidence

Public records contain conclusions and open questions. Detailed provenance is maintained in `.okf/evidence-ledger.jsonl` and `.okf/claim-map.yaml`.

## Identifier and File Rules

IDs are permanent and never reused. Filenames use the stable ID followed by a lowercase hyphenated title. Collection `index.md` files are reserved and do not represent model records.

## Modelling Rules

- Model business outcomes before technology.
- Keep data quality under Quality Controls.
- Keep operational concerns under Operational Capabilities.
- Treat only real external originators as Sources.
- Separate current, transitional, and target state.
- Record unknowns instead of inventing facts.
- Maintain inverse relationships where defined.

